<h2 class="h4 mb-3">单用户余额调整</h2><form method="post" class="card p-3 admin-form"><?= csrf_field() ?><div class="mb-3"><label class="form-label">用户 ID</label><input class="form-control" type="number" name="user_id" required></div><div class="mb-3"><label class="form-label">金额</label><input class="form-control" type="number" step="0.01" name="amount" required><div class="form-help">增加填正数，扣除填负数。</div></div><div class="mb-3"><label class="form-label">原因（必填）</label><textarea class="form-control" name="reason" required></textarea></div><div class="mb-3"><label class="form-label">大额确认密码</label><input class="form-control" type="password" name="admin_password" autocomplete="current-password"><div class="form-text">金额达到「大额确认金额」时需要填写登录密码。</div></div><div class="mb-3"><label class="form-label">谷歌验证码</label><input class="form-control" name="admin_2fa_code" inputmode="numeric" maxlength="6" autocomplete="one-time-code"><div class="form-text">已开启两步验证的管理员，大额调整时还需要填写（5 分钟内验证过可不填）。</div></div><div class="form-check"><input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" name="notify" value="1"><label class="form-check-label">通知用户</label></div><div class="form-check mb-3"><input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" name="allow_negative" value="1"><label class="form-check-label">允许余额为负</label></div><button class="btn btn-primary">提交调整</button></form>